@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080

### 샌드박스 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sandbox

### 기준선 새로 고침(202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sandbox/refresh

### 분석
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sql": "UPDATE Sales.SalesOrderDetail SET OrderQty = OrderQty + 1 WHERE SalesOrderDetailID = 1;" }

### 미리보기
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/previews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sql": "DELETE FROM Sales.SalesOrderHeader WHERE SalesOrderID = 43659;", "options": { "imageCap": 100000 } }

### 거부(422 기대)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/previews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sql": "TRUNCATE TABLE Sales.SalesOrderDetail;" }

### 결과
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/previews/pv_00000000_0001

### 행 페이지(발동 보기)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/previews/pv_00000000_0001/rows?view=event&offset=0&limit=100

### 행 페이지(최종 차이 보기)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/previews/pv_00000000_0001/rows?view=net

### 없는 id(404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/previews/none

### 취소(204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/previews/pv_00000000_0001/cancel

### 내보내기
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/previews/pv_00000000_0001/export

### OpenAPI(개발 환경)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
